                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Stupid GAME ——0/10\r\nA self-righteous piece that's already immersed in its own stupid art.\r\nNo guidance at all, just some boring and weird patterns. At the same time, the controls are super unintuitive and really messy. Almost every interface has a different way of operating, like the main menu (arrow keys) and the pause menu (if I remember correctly, it was tg), and they aren't even the same type of controls. Using tgfh to choose directions is really unique. Trying to add multiplayer on top of this is certainly an unusual move.",
